---
import SimpleLayout from '../layouts/SimpleLayout.astro';
const updated = 'November 18, 2026';
---
<SimpleLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Vice City Support handles data, cookies, local storage and third-party advertising.">
  <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains what information vicecitysupport.com ("we", "us") collects and how it is used. By using this site you agree to this policy.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> if you use our contact form, we receive the information you enter (name, email, message). It is processed by our host, Netlify, and used only to respond to you.</li>
    <li><strong>Location submissions:</strong> if you send us a location, we receive what you enter (the location details, and optionally a screenshot, platform, credit name and email). Location details and any credit name you give may be published on the map. Your email is used only to contact you about the submission.</li>
    <li><strong>Email updates:</strong> if you ask to be notified about new verified locations, we store the email address you give and your consent, and use it only to send those updates. Every email includes an unsubscribe link, and you can ask us to remove you at any time through the contact form.</li>
    <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> our host may automatically log technical data such as IP address, browser type and pages visited, for security and performance.</li>
    <li><strong>Checklist progress:</strong> collectible checklists are saved in your browser's <em>local storage</em> on your own device. This data is never sent to us. You can clear it at any time with the "Reset" button or by clearing your browser data.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>This site is funded by advertising. We use, or may use, third-party advertising partners such as Google AdSense and other ad networks. These partners may use cookies, web beacons and similar technologies to show ads based on your visits to this and other websites, to limit how often you see an ad, and to measure ad performance.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites.</li>
    <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
    <li>You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Visitors in the EEA, the UK and Switzerland are shown a consent message, provided by Google, before any personalised advertising cookies are used. You can change your choice at any time using the privacy or cookie settings link that message adds to the page.</p>
  <p>We may also use privacy-friendly analytics to understand which guides are useful. If analytics cookies are used, they will be listed here.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. If you are in the EEA, UK or California, you may have rights to access, correct, delete or object to the processing of your personal data, and (where required) we will ask for your consent before setting non-essential cookies. To make a request, use our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is not directed to children under 13 (or under 16 in the EEA), and we do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>
</SimpleLayout>
